quakecon with the thing that happened  recently and bethesda took the  opportunity to reveal some new details  about fallout 4s perks and companions it  turns out your canine companion dog meat  is modeled on the lead designers dog  which is definitely something you need  to know and they filmed it doing all  sorts of things to make the look of the  digital version more realistic just like  Infinity Ward did with call of duty  ghosts dog meat can be found early in  the game when you leave the vault and it  seems he'll be a pretty handy sidekick  since he can be sent into buildings to  explore for loot as you go off and do  more important things other companions  include mr. handy the robot assistant  Preston Garvey who leads the  Commonwealth Minutemen faction which you  can join and Piper a charismatic and  manipulative resident of Fenway Park  near diamond city all your human  companions are romantical regardless of  gender and there are a dozen possible  companions all up there are also special  perks you can learn to assist you if you  prefer to play without a companion  speaking of which the game reaches 70  perks all of which have their own set of  ranks which amount to 275 different  iterations while a number of animations  have been created through immersion  captcha faces are procedurally animated  meaning that there are predefined mouth  movements that correspond to letters and  syllables so Thursday also revealed that  mobile game fallout shelter will make  its way to Android devices next month  for more fallout 2 goodness and  everything else that matters in gaming  be sure to stay tuned to gamespot
 

